    "sections": {
        "description": "Integlight transforms your knowledge and experience into digital assets. Integlight is a lightweight, fast, and responsive WordPress theme that guides your content to become valuable digital assets. With a clean layout that makes effective use of whitespace, refined typography, and eight professionally curated color variations, your content naturally stands out. No coding is required — you can intuitively customize colors, layouts, and typography using the WordPress Customizer. Suitable for everyone seeking a polished and sophisticated look, from personal blogs to business websites."
    },
